// The stylesheets that come with xWorks (project owner, 2026-10-24, review
// 30dmn1js), by their files in spec/styles/, in the order File, New with
// Stylesheet lists them. New documents copy the first unless the person
// chooses another.
//
// Each counts its version up when it changes, and the version it replaces
// is kept, frozen, in spec/styles/versions/ as NAME-VERSION.ron (review
// sjj5ak5a): a document records the version it copied, and takes a newer
// one three-way, with what that one changed since and nothing else.
(
    stylesheets: ["neutral", "book", "literary", "modern", "technical", "manuscript"],
)
